  message: "ADDENDUM (final state when stopped, 21:17): the v5 in-run probe stopped after one asset file ran >794 s in crypto-flow without finishing. The standalone binary-asset bench stopped on asset #832 (the next-largest after the 950 KB one) after ~13 min unfinished. So single binary files cost from tens of seconds to >13 min each, and crypto-flow on nextjs is unbounded in practice. No run completed a survey."  # b766
